      "html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"faq-heading\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden py-14 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 bg-kar-cream\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 [aspect-ratio:1717/916]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 [aspect-ratio:1717/916]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(252,250,247,0) 0%, rgba(252,250,247,0.62) 24%, rgba(252,250,247,0.62) 76%, rgba(252,250,247,0) 100%)\"></div><div class=\"container relative\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-normal text-kar-chocolate sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\" id=\"faq-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions</h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base+ leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Everything we are asked most often about adopting a Ragdoll kitten from us — pricing, payment, health testing, visits, and how kittens travel home.</p></div></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "key": "faq-1",
      "html": "<section class=\"bg-kar-ivory py-14 sm:py-16 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"accordian space-y-3\" data-accordion-type=\"single\"><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border transition-colors duration-300 border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-blush\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-xs font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex border-kar-rose bg-kar-ivory-bright text-kar-rose\">1</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Are you TICA registered?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Yes. Astrid Moon Cattery is a registered cattery with The International Cat Association, and we breed under our registered cattery name. Our breeding cats' registered names and pedigrees are listed on our <a href=\"/our-cats\">kings and queens page</a>.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">2</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Where are you located?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">In Austin, Texas. We're a home cattery serving Austin and surrounding areas.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">3</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">How do I adopt a Ragdoll kitten?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">To adopt a Ragdoll kitten from Astrid Moon Cattery, submit a Kitten Application through our website. Once approved, you can reserve your kitten and complete the adoption agreement.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">4</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">What age are the kittens available for adoption?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Families usually meet the kittens and choose around 6-8 weeks. Early spay/neuter is done at approximately 11-12 weeks, and kittens go home at 12 weeks or older, once they have recovered from surgery and been cleared by our veterinarian, with microchipping and age-appropriate vaccinations complete. Some kittens stay longer when they need it.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">5</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Do you offer a health guarantee for your kittens?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Yes. Every kitten comes with a written two-year genetic health guarantee, and you can read the full terms in our sample contract. We guarantee that your kitten's breeding parents have been DNA-tested and do not carry two copies of the R820W (MYBPC3) mutation associated with Ragdoll HCM, and are negative for the PKD1 mutation associated with polycystic kidney disease. If a board-certified veterinary specialist diagnoses your cat with HCM caused by the R820W mutation, or PKD caused by the PKD1 mutation, within two years of go-home, we will offer a replacement kitten of equal value from a future litter, with timing and selection at our discretion. No cash refunds are provided, and if a cat has died a necropsy report confirming the genetic cause is required. Families cover necropsy and specialist costs. The guarantee does not cover other conditions, is void if the cat is bred, kept outdoors or does not receive annual veterinary care, and a veterinary exam within 72 hours of go-home is strongly recommended.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">6</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Are deposits refundable?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Deposits are non-refundable. They never expire and are applied toward the total adoption fee once your application is approved. If you cancel, the deposit is forfeited, but at our discretion it may be applied toward a future kitten from us.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">7</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">How much are your kittens?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">$4,500 per kitten, flat — the same price regardless of color, pattern, sex or eye color. A $1,000 non-refundable deposit reserves your kitten, and the $3,500 balance is due before pickup.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">8</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">How do I pay, and what payment methods do you accept?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">We accept three payment methods: <strong>Zelle</strong> (to astridmooncattery@gmail.com; confirm the recipient name with us before sending), <strong>cash</strong> in person at pickup, and a <strong>cashier's check</strong> (email us to confirm the payee name). We do not accept credit cards, personal checks, Venmo, Cash App, or PayPal. A $1,000 deposit reserves your kitten and the $3,500 balance is due before your kitten goes home — a flat $4,500 total per kitten. Deposits are non-refundable and apply toward the total. Because cash is in person and a cashier's check must arrive first, Zelle is the only method that can secure a deposit remotely.<br/><br/>Zelle limits vary by bank — check yours before sending. Most banks will raise your daily limit if you call them, though some decline requests for pet purchases. If your limit is lower than the amount due, email me at astridmooncattery@gmail.com and we'll work out timing that works for your bank — split payments across days, or cash or a cashier's check instead.<br/><br/>I confirm every deposit by email within 24 hours. If you don't hear from me, email astridmooncattery@gmail.com.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">9</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Can I see the kittens before adoption?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">In person, yes — once your application is approved and your deposit is placed, we'll arrange a time for you to come and meet them.<br/><br/>Before that, you can see more than a scheduled call would ever show you. We keep a public, standing video record: years of video filmed inside our own home and cattery across Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, and YouTube, plus a feature on The Cat Butler, a third-party channel we don't control. You don't have to ask and you don't have to wait — it's all there right now, and it's a deeper and more current picture than one call could give.<br/><br/>Same name, same Austin, Texas location, same email address everywhere you find us.<br/><br/>Have a question about a specific kitten? Email astridmooncattery@gmail.com.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">10</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">How do you socialize your Ragdoll kittens?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Our kittens are raised in a loving home environment with daily socialization to ensure they grow into affectionate and well-adjusted companions.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">11</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Do you health test your cats?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Yes. Every cat in our breeding program has a genetic panel run. Those panels include the HCM-associated mutation and the PKD1 mutation, along with coat, color and blood type. To be precise about what that means: genetic testing tells you whether a cat carries a specific known mutation. It is not the same as a cardiac ultrasound, and we don't describe our cats as \"heart tested.\" Every kitten also has a veterinary clearance exam before going home.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">12</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Do you ship kittens?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">We don't ship kittens as cargo. For families outside driving distance we arrange a flight nanny, who carries your kitten in the cabin as their own carry-on and hands them to you the same day. Closer to home, we offer pickup in Austin, Texas, or — depending on your location — we can meet partway or arrange ground delivery for a fee.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">13</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Will I get photos of my kitten before go-home?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Yes. Every week from birth until go-home we photograph your kitten with a professional camera, and a weekly email links you to a private Google Drive folder where you can view the photos.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">14</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Can I download and keep the baby photos?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Yes. The photos in your kitten's private Google Drive folder are yours to download and keep as a record of your kitten's earliest weeks.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">15</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Do you take professional portraits of the kittens?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Yes. At approximately 10 weeks, every litter has a professional photo session, and those portraits are keepsakes for the families.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">16</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">What support is available after my kitten goes home?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Lifetime breeder support means our relationship does not end when your kitten goes home. KAR families may contact us throughout their cat's life with questions about adjustment, care, behavior and health, and we will help whenever we reasonably can. Our guidance does not replace care from a licensed veterinarian.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">17</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Why do you send annual health surveys?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">We invite families to complete a yearly health survey so we can track long-term outcomes and keep improving our program. Taking part is optional. The survey does not replace veterinary care and does not prevent illness or guarantee savings.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">18</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Is there an Astrid Moon Cattery community?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">We are building a place for KAR families to share photos, milestones, questions and honest experiences. Our Reddit profile is live, and Facebook and Discord spaces are planned but not open yet. Membership is optional and is never required to adopt a kitten. See the community page for details.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">19</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Where do I contact you about a health concern with my kitten?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Contact us directly at astridmooncattery@gmail.com, and contact your licensed veterinarian right away for anything urgent. Community groups are not the place for medical emergencies, and nothing shared in them replaces veterinary care.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">20</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">How can I tell a payment request really came from Astrid Moon Cattery?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">We accept payment only by Zelle to astridmooncattery@gmail.com, cash in person, or a cashier's check. Email us to confirm the recipient or payee name before sending payment. We never ask for payment through Facebook, Discord, Reddit, Instagram or any other social platform, and we do not accept gift cards or cryptocurrency. If you are unsure whether a request is real, email astridmooncattery@gmail.com before sending anything.</p></details></div></div></div></section>"
    }
  ]
}
